# Local-only working notes. Scratch design and planning documents that are not part of the
# published repository, so nothing committed here may link to them.
work/

# Local-only tooling configuration: agent settings and MCP server definitions. The .NET tool
# manifest in .config/ stays committed, because 'dotnet tool restore' has to work everywhere.
.claude/
.mcp.json

# Local-only secrets. Integration tests read credentials from environment
# variables; never commit a credential file even by accident.
*.local.json
secrets.json
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# Credential files by the names the tools that produce them actually use. Extensions were not
# enough: every one of these is JSON, and it is the name that identifies it.
#
#   client_secret_*.json          what the Cloud Console downloads for an OAuth client
#   credentials.json              what Google's own guide tells you to save a service account key as
#   token.json                    what the quickstarts write the resulting tokens to
#   gha-creds-*.json              what google-github-actions/auth writes into the workspace
#   application_default_credentials.json   what `gcloud auth application-default login` writes
#
# A leaked client secret is the accident this repository is most likely to have, because the file
# arrives in the working directory already named and nobody types its name.
client_secret*.json
credentials.json
token.json
*service-account*.json
*-credentials.json
gha-creds-*.json
application_default_credentials.json

# The specification snapshots, named one by one. A blanket !spec/v4/*.json would re-include
# anything later dropped in that directory — including a file the rules above were meant to keep
# out, since a negation after them wins.
!spec/v4/discovery.json
!spec/v4/metadata.json
!spec/v4/public-surface.json
!spec/v4/semantics.json
!spec/v4/errors.json
!spec/v4/data-types.json

# Screenshots pasted into the editor. Local, and they tend to contain whatever was on screen.
.clipshot/
# Browser automation scratch output. Snapshots of whatever page was open, which is
# nobody else's business and never part of a change.
.playwright-cli/


# ブラウザ操作ツールのローカル設定。成果物ではない。
.playwright/
.playwright-cli/
